### Complete practical — start to end

**1. Start Blockchain**

```powershell
npx hardhat node
```

**2. Compile Contract**

```powershell
npx hardhat compile
```

**3. Smart Contract Tests**

```powershell
npx hardhat test
```

**4. Register Original Assets**

```powershell
python .\scripts\register_assets.py --tool "Google Gemini"
```

**5. AI — Normal / No Anomaly**

```powershell
python .\ai\anomaly_detector.py
```

**6. Create Anomaly — Duplicate Asset**

```powershell
Copy-Item .\assets\asset_001.png .\assets\asset_001_duplicate.png
```

**7. Register Duplicate**

```powershell
python .\scripts\register_assets.py --tool "Google Gemini"
```

**8. AI — Detect Anomaly**

```powershell
python .\ai\anomaly_detector.py
```

Expected:

```text
Anomalies detected: 1
DUPLICATE_CONTENT_DIGEST
```

**9. Show Which Asset Is Anomaly**

```powershell
python .\ai\anomaly_detector.py
```

It should show the duplicate asset IDs sharing the same content digest.

**10. Remove Test Anomaly**

```powershell
Remove-Item .\assets\asset_001_duplicate.png
```

**11. Restore Clean Asset Evidence**

```powershell
python .\scripts\register_assets.py --tool "Google Gemini"
```

**12. Confirm No Anomaly Again**

```powershell
python .\ai\anomaly_detector.py
```

Expected:

```text
Anomalies detected: 0
Current sample result: NO ANOMALIES
```

---

### Blockchain Demo

**13. Complete Blockchain Demo**

```powershell
npx hardhat run .\scripts\run_full_demo.js --network localhost
```

**14. Original Asset — MATCH**

```powershell
node .\verification\verify_against_blockchain.js 1 .\assets\asset_001.png
```

Expected:

```text
VERIFICATION RESULT: MATCH
```

**15. Tampered Image — MISMATCH**

```powershell
node .\verification\test_tampered_asset.js
```

Expected:

```text
VERIFICATION RESULT: MISMATCH
```

**16. Token 2 Provenance**

```powershell
npx hardhat run .\scripts\queryTokenTwo.js --network localhost
```

**17. Token 1 Provenance / Dispute**

```powershell
$env:TOKEN_ID="1"
npx hardhat run .\scripts\queryProvenance.js --network localhost
node .\scripts\queryProvenance.js 1
```

Expected:

```text
Disputed: true
```

**18. Dashboard**

```powershell
python -m streamlit run .\client\app.py
```
